JEMM386 5.87, the FreeDOS EMS/VCPI/UMB memory manager, Artistic License
(Artistic.txt; Readme.txt section 9).
Source: https://github.com/Baron-von-Riedesel/Jemm, commit e96bb6bb80cbdc3e6585544db79a6b133a5566dd.

JEMM386.EXE is prebuilt, unmodified: make -f Linux.mak with JWasm and
JWlink (https://github.com/Baron-von-Riedesel/JWasm, .../JWlink).

For VMHV's virtual machine only (FDCONFIG.SYS menu choice 2, README.md);
in V86 mode vmdos provides EMS itself.
